==Line-crossing ceremonies==
{{Main|Line-crossing ceremony}}

There is a widespread maritime tradition of holding ceremonies to mark a sailor's first crossing of the equator. In the past, these ceremonies have been notorious for their brutality, especially in naval practice.{{citation needed|date=April 2017}} Milder line-crossing ceremonies, typically featuring [[Neptune (mythology)|King Neptune]], are also held for passengers' entertainment on some civilian ocean liners and cruise ships.{{citation needed|date=January 2015}}

